From e6c0725a726ebce2fce98e90f6f05575b6a78185 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 12:45:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 955/957] wifi: ath11k: keep the radios when a firmware
 recovery fails

ath11k_core_qmi_firmware_ready() serves both the cold boot and the
firmware crash recovery path. ath11k_mac_allocate() returns early once
ATH11K_FLAG_REGISTERED is set, so on a recovery the radios are the ones
mac80211 has held since the cold boot and no allocation takes place.

The error unwind makes no such distinction. ath11k_core_start() and
ath11k_core_qmi_firmware_ready() both call ath11k_mac_destroy()
unconditionally, so a recovery that fails hands ieee80211_free_hw() an
ieee80211_hw that mac80211 and its users still reference, and leaves
ab->pdevs[i].ar NULL behind:

  ath11k c000000.wifi: failed to receive wmi unified ready event: -110
  Have pending ack frames!
  WARNING: CPU: 2 PID: 71 at net/mac80211/main.c:1696
  Workqueue: ath11k_wq ath11k_core_restart
  Call trace:
   ieee80211_free_ack_frame+0x58/0x60 [mac80211] (P)
   idr_for_each+0x54/0xc0
   ieee80211_free_hw+0x30/0x470 [mac80211]
   ath11k_mac_destroy+0x50/0x84 [ath11k]
   ath11k_core_qmi_firmware_ready+0x504/0x584 [ath11k]
   ath11k_core_restart+0xf8/0x194 [ath11k]

The next crash then carries that NULL ar into ath11k_dp_pdev_free(),

  Unable to handle kernel read from unreadable memory at virtual address 0
  Call trace:
   ath11k_dp_rx_pdev_free+0x34/0x13c [ath11k] (P)
   ath11k_dp_pdev_free+0x4c/0x84 [ath11k]
   ath11k_core_restart+0x80/0x194 [ath11k]

and a station lookup from hostapd follows the freed hw into
sta_info_hash_lookup().

Destroy the radios only when this call allocated them, which is the
condition ath11k_mac_allocate() already uses to decide whether to
allocate.

Tested-on: IPQ8074 hw2.0 AHB WLAN.HK.2.9.0.1-02146-QCAHKSWPL_SILICONZ-1

Fixes: 0366f42640a4 ("ath11k: Move mac80211 hw allocation before wmi_init command")
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261018210153.1925962-3-julius@bairaktaris.de/
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/core.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/core.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/core.c
@@ -2376,7 +2376,8 @@ static int ath11k_core_start(struct ath1
 err_reo_cleanup:
 	ath11k_dp_pdev_reo_cleanup(ab);
 err_mac_destroy:
-	ath11k_mac_destroy(ab);
+	if (!test_bit(ATH11K_FLAG_REGISTERED, &ab->dev_flags))
+		ath11k_mac_destroy(ab);
 err_hif_stop:
 	ath11k_hif_stop(ab);
 err_wmi_detach:
@@ -2460,7 +2461,8 @@ int ath11k_core_qmi_firmware_ready(struc
 
 err_core_stop:
 	ath11k_core_stop(ab);
-	ath11k_mac_destroy(ab);
+	if (!test_bit(ATH11K_FLAG_REGISTERED, &ab->dev_flags))
+		ath11k_mac_destroy(ab);
 err_dp_free:
 	ath11k_dp_free(ab);
 	mutex_unlock(&ab->core_lock);
